              "text": "The animal saw him and cried out.",
              "audioStart": 25.038,
              "audioEnd": 26.788
            },
            {
              "text": "The animal asked the man to let him out of that dark place.",
              "audioStart": 27.65,
              "audioEnd": 30.762
