        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "The man felt very sorry for the individual.",
              "audioStart": 31.625,
              "audioEnd": 33.962
            },
            {
              "text": "He stopped to think about what he should do.",
              "audioStart": 34.825,
              "audioEnd": 36.788
            },
            {
              "text": "The animal promised that he would never hurt anyone if he were set free.",
              "audioStart": 37.65,
              "audioEnd": 41.212
            },
            {
              "text": "Trusting his word, the kind man opened the heavy door.",
              "audioStart": 42.075,
              "audioEnd": 45.1
            },
            {
              "text": "He let the animal step outside into the open air.",
              "audioStart": 45.962,
              "audioEnd": 48.55
            },
            {
              "text": "However, the bad animal immediately jumped toward the man.",
              "audioStart": 49.413,
