        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Sometimes a dangerous situation might happen when someone tries to help the wrong person.",
              "audioStart": 181.55,
              "audioEnd": 186.1
            },
            {
              "text": "Therefore, people must always use their head and think before they act in life.",
